      "raw": "<p>Hello! I discovered the Letters Page podcast about a week ago. Since then I have listened to about fifteen episodes, downloaded the phone game, bought the card game, and ordered the RPG Starter Set. This is a crazy cool world that I'm absolutely falling in love with. But, I don't want to be a poseur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, what do I need to do next to become a part of this community, participate in the upcoming shenanigans, and be the best fan I can be?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, here's a doodle of Haka, because he's my favorite and I hope you'll find it endearing.</p>\n\n![IMG_0519.JPG|1452x1936](upload://tadrEaRgHlAxPNrda7V6oQirAML.jpeg)",
